 ("How much does it cost to build a custom AI system in Singapore?","Studios that scope custom builds from scratch do not publish prices, so the honest answer is that it depends on the scope and you get a quote. 41 Labs no longer sells project builds. 41 Closer is S$690 a month on Starter and S$1,490 on Pro, with the build included and no setup fee. Connecting a system of your own is a one-time S$2,400 for a platform we have connected before. No GST is charged. Eligible Singapore SMEs can apply the EDGE grant, which replaced the EDG on 30 September 2026, to part of the cost."),
