 ("Do you develop anything other than the sales agent?","Only the connections around it: your systems into the agent and the agent's orders and bookings back into your systems. We do not take standalone custom builds, document-processing projects or consulting engagements any more. If that is what you need we will say so on the first message and point you to someone who does it."),
